Hi Avery,

Thank you for being a member this year. Your Family Membership expires on April 30, 2026.

Renew before April 15 and we'll add a free guest pass to your account, good for one adult and one child on any regular day.

Family Membership: $165/year, unlimited admission for 2 adults and up to 4 children, member-only mornings on the first Sunday of each month, and 10% off camps and birthday parties.

Coming this spring: the new Water Works exhibit opens April 4, and summer camp registration for members opens April 1, two weeks before the public.

Renew now: https://eastbaychildrensmuseum.org/renew

With thanks,
